   "what": "Beds are wide, decorrelated noise (L/R +0.22 / +0.17 / +0.62) and lose 2.2 / 2.3 / 0.9 dB summed to mono. They are not anti-correlated (no cancellation); this is normal for a stereo bed."
  },
